<title>GERMANY: Kopper to remain at Daimler-Benz - report.</title>
<headline>Kopper to remain at Daimler-Benz - report.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank chairman Hilmar Kopper is to remain head of the supervisory board of industrial group Daimler-Benz AG after he leaves his post at Deutsche next May, Germany's Spiegel magazine said.</p>
<p>In an advance copy of an article to be published on Monday, Spiegel said Kopper would remain within the Daimler supervisory board until 1998.</p>
<p>Daimler is one of Deutsche's main corporate shareholdings and the post of Deutsche Bank chairman has traditionally carried with it the leadership of Daimler's supervisory board.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
